flowchart LR
    Browser[User Browser]
    FastAPI[FastAPI + Jinja2]
    Auth[Auth / Session]
    DB[(SQLite DB)]
    AI[External AI API]
    Logs[Application Logs]

    Browser -->|signup/login/chat| FastAPI
    FastAPI --> Auth
    Auth --> DB
    FastAPI -->|recent user context| DB
    FastAPI -->|server-side API call| AI
    AI -->|AI answer| FastAPI
    FastAPI -->|save Q/A| DB
    FastAPI --> Logs
    FastAPI -->|HTML response| Browser
